# Contributors to the code of the original R package CARD, ported here
Ivan, Horner
    wrote the original R functions for the flow duration curve, the
    performance criteria and the seasonal dynamics (2020), ported and
    adapted in card.functions
Leonard, Santos
    wrote the original R functions for the RAT criteria (2021), ported
    and adapted in card.functions
David, Dorchies <david.dorchies@inrae.fr>*2
    contributed to the R code (return periods in 2022, management and
    processing of the cards in 2025) and reported issues; also took part
    in the design

